---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="Experience | Shivan Tillekeratne"
  description="Professional experience of Shivan Tillekeratne as an AI Engineer and AI/ML Engineer."
>

  <!-- Page Header -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20">

    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500">
        Experience
      </p>

      <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 md:text-5xl">
        Building AI systems from ideas to implementation.
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-gray-600">
        My professional experience has involved developing practical AI
        solutions, intelligent assistants, automation systems, and
        software integrations across different stages of the development
        lifecycle.
      </p>
    </div>


    <!-- Current Role -->
    <div class="mt-16 border-l-2 border-gray-200 pl-6">

      <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between">

        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500">
            Current Role
          </p>

          <h2 class="mt-2 text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
            AI Engineer
          </h2>

          <p class="mt-1 font-medium text-gray-700">
            Inxai Pvt Ltd · Working with AllDigital Specialty
          </p>
        </div>

        <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">
          Sep 2026 - Present
        </p>

      </div>

      <p class="mt-6 max-w-4xl leading-7 text-gray-600">
        Working on practical AI engineering initiatives involving
        artificial intelligence solutions, software integration, and
        intelligent systems.
      </p>

    </div>


    <!-- Previous Experience -->
    <div class="mt-16">

      <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-gray-500">
        Previous Experience
      </p>

      <h2 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900">
        AI/ML Engineering Experience
      </h2>

      <div class="mt-10 space-y-12">

        <!-- Associate AI/ML Engineer -->
        <article class="border-l-2 border-gray-200 pl-6">

          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between">

            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
                Associate AI/ML Engineer
              </h3>

              <p class="mt-1 font-medium text-gray-700">
                Vinasai Incorporation
              </p>
            </div>

            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">
              Aug 2025 - Aug 2026
            </p>

          </div>

          <p class="mt-5 max-w-4xl leading-7 text-gray-600">
            Worked on practical AI products and software solutions involving
            AI assistants, automation platforms, natural language processing,
            prompt engineering, API integrations, testing, documentation,
            and deployment-oriented development.
          </p>

          <ul class="mt-5 max-w-4xl list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 leading-7 text-gray-600">

            <li>
              Developed and worked with AI-powered assistants and chatbot systems.
            </li>

            <li>
              Worked on AI automation workflows and integrations with external APIs.
            </li>

            <li>
              Applied NLP and prompt engineering techniques to practical AI systems.
            </li>

            <li>
              Contributed to documentation, testing, and deployment preparation.
            </li>

            <li>
              Participated in Agile/Scrum-based development and cross-functional
              collaboration.
            </li>

          </ul>

        </article>


        <!-- AI/ML Engineer Internship -->
        <article class="border-l-2 border-gray-200 pl-6">

          <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row sm:items-baseline sm:justify-between">

            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900">
                AI/ML Engineer Intern
              </h3>

              <p class="mt-1 font-medium text-gray-700">
                Vinasai Incorporation
              </p>
            </div>

            <p class="text-sm text-gray-500">
              Feb 2025 - July 2025
            </p>

          </div>

          <p class="mt-5 max-w-4xl leading-7 text-gray-600">
            Completed a six-month AI/ML engineering internship, gaining
            practical experience across the AI/software development
            lifecycle while working in an Agile environment.
          </p>

          <ul class="mt-5 max-w-4xl list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 leading-7 text-gray-600">

            <li>
              Worked on AI and machine learning related development tasks.
            </li>

            <li>
              Gained hands-on experience with AI assistants, NLP,
              automation, and API-based systems.
            </li>

            <li>
              Contributed to technical documentation and project development.
            </li>

            <li>
              Developed communication, presentation, collaboration, and
              leadership skills through practical project work.
            </li>

          </ul>

        </article>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>

</MainLayout>